<title>USA: TABLE - N. American Vaccine Q2 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>TABLE - N. American Vaccine Q2 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BELTSVILLE, Md. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Six Months Ended</p>
<p>					    June 30,	June 30,</p>
<p>				   1997	1996     1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		     $1,063     $499    $2,138	$727</p>
<p>Gain on sale of</p>
<p>  investment in affiliate	-	  -	   -     4,228</p>
<p> Net loss		   (11,248)  (8,102)  (23,355)  (10,617)</p>
<p> Net loss per share	 (0.36)   (0.26)    (0.74)    (0.35)</p>
<p>Weighted-average number</p>
<p>of common shares</p>
<p>  outstanding		 31,608   30,591    31,593    30,515</p>
<p>NOTE: North American Vaccine Inc said its net income for the first six months of 1997 included a $1.3 million non-cash expense related to the extension of an expiring stock option.</p>
<p>The company said the increase in the number of weighted-average shares outstanding for 1997 as compared with 1996 is attributable primarily to the exercise of stock options and the sale of 350,000 shares of common stock to Abbott Laboratories Inc in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
